    "notes": [
      "The attack speed granted from a deployed Demacian Standard stacks additively with Demacian Standard's passive permanent bonus attack speed to Jarvan IV, but the aura from multiple Demacian Standards does not stack.\n  - Jarvan IV gains a total of 40 / 45 / 50 / 55 / 60% bonus attack speed from Demacian Standard while near the flag.",
